SPARTA-GUI welcome-screen example thumbnails
============================================

The PNG images in this directory are the rendered example stills published
in the official SPARTA picture gallery:

    https://sparta.github.io/pictures.html

They were produced by the SPARTA developers (Sandia National Laboratories)
from the corresponding decks in SPARTA's own examples/ tree, and are reused
here -- downscaled to 256x256 -- as the thumbnail for each example deck shown
on the SPARTA-GUI welcome screen.  Each file is named
"<example-subdir>__<in.file>.png" so the welcome screen can look it up from a
deck's path; only the example decks that have a matching gallery image are
shown as thumbnails, the rest are simply omitted.

